---
import WaxLadyLayout from "../layouts/WaxLadyLayout.astro";
---
<WaxLadyLayout title="FAQs | Wax Lady" description="Common questions about waxing appointments with Wax Lady in Stowmarket." active="/faq">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Frequently asked questions</span>
    <h1>Know what to expect.</h1>
    <p>First-time questions are welcome. These are the things clients commonly want to understand before booking.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="faq-list">
      <article class="faq-item"><h3>How should I prepare before my appointment?</h3><p>Follow the preparation guidance provided before your appointment. If you're unsure whether your hair length or skin condition is suitable, get in touch before booking.</p></article>
      <article class="faq-item"><h3>Does waxing hurt?</h3><p>Waxing can be uncomfortable, and the website does not promise a pain-free treatment. Your appointment is handled professionally and at a pace intended to help you feel comfortable.</p></article>
      <article class="faq-item"><h3>What happens during an intimate wax?</h3><p>The treatment is carried out privately and professionally. If you're unsure about the difference between intimate waxing options, ask before booking so the right appointment can be chosen.</p></article>
      <article class="faq-item"><h3>How long will my appointment take?</h3><p>Times vary by treatment. If timing is important, ask when you book.</p></article>
      <article class="faq-item"><h3>How often should I book?</h3><p>The best schedule depends on your treatment and individual needs. Joanne can advise based on the service you choose.</p></article>
      <article class="faq-item"><h3>Is there anything I should mention before treatment?</h3><p>Yes. Tell Joanne about allergies, skin conditions, medication or health issues that may affect your treatment. Some treatments may not be suitable in certain circumstances.</p></article>
      <article class="faq-item"><h3>Where are you based?</h3><p>Appointments are provided from a private treatment room in Stowmarket. Exact location details are provided through the booking process rather than being invented here.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</WaxLadyLayout>